ent from the File Impact list, which enumerates only the atomic-PASS builder path (completion_bundle.py) plus emitter/gate/schema/test files. Whether these two callers must change is left implicit.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fcd8a4c840d09db43","impact":0.44,"is_primary":null,"location":"Fix plan — 'File impact' list vs. 'Close-time and standalone emitters pass material=None' clause","norm_id":"nd30c8a566c1688b7","priority":0.165,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A close-time FAIL sidecar (close_precheck path) or a standalone verify-completion FAIL sidecar (transition_close path) must carry the new fingerprint/version, but the design derives material inside build_payload so the `material=None` argument at these sites is now dead/misleading and left unaddressed","Implementer edits only build_payload and the atomic-PASS caller, leaving the two `material=None` arguments — producing sidecars whose explicit argument contradicts the derived value"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add a sentence to the Fix plan clarifying that build_payload derives material/verifier_version from the verdict dict (completion_read_basis, prefetch manifest, plan material fingerprint) so the two `emit(material=None)` call sites need no edit; or, if they must pass the values, add close_precheck.py and transition_close.py to the File impact list.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.375,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radi