he run-path source of content_sha256 — is not invoked before the preflight outage).","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f0d10ad3422e874c9","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Fix plan → 'Version contract' and 'Shared ERROR scope' (produce_completion_verdict preflight)","norm_id":"n5fa900364522446c","priority":0.099,"reason":"veto:absence-refuted","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A provider outage trips runner_sel.preflight(); the completion gate emits a gate_error_v1 sidecar with material_basis=error_unpinned but must still stamp verifier_version — with no resolved prompt meta to read the content hash from."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"In the Version contract, state that the ERROR (and any pre-run) path derives prompt_content_sha256 by loading the completion-verifier prompt by id and applying prompt_content_hash (prompts.py:602), rather than depending on a resolve_prompt meta that only exists after the verify step runs.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.375,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}},{"block_threshold":0.9,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Re-derive the completion ERROR call-site inventory via find_referencing_symbols on emit_gate_error and add the files the named symbols actually live in — src/rebar/llm/workflow/gate_dispatch.py (produce_completion_verdict preflight, line 687) and src/rebar/llm/workflow/completion_failures.py (raise_completion_workflow_failure, line 227) — to File impact, or state why enrichment lands wholly inside gate_error_sidecar.py without editing either call site.","cohort":["project.symbol-reference-completeness"],"criteria":["project.symbol-reference-completeness"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.735,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: 'Completion ERROR call sites covered: produce_completion_verdict preflight and completion_failures.raise_completion_workflow_failure.'","Plan File impact list: 'src/rebar/llm/completion_sidecar.py; src/rebar/_commands/completion_bundle.py; src/rebar/llm/workflow/gate_ops.py; ...; src/rebar/llm/gate_error_sidecar.py; tests/...' — no gate_dispatch.py, no completion_failures.py.","grep: src/rebar/llm/workflow/gate_dispatch.py:687: emit_gate_error(ticket_id, \"completion\", cause=str(exc), repo_root=repo_root) — inside produce_completion_verdict (defined gate_dispatch.py:649).","grep: src/rebar/llm/workflow/completion_failures.py:227: emit_gate_error(...) — inside raise_completion_workflow_failure (defined completion_failures.py:207).","grep of gate_ops.py for emit_gate_error: no matches (it hosts completion_precheck/reconcile/passthrough only)."],"finding":"The plan names the two completion ERROR call sites by symbol (produce_completion_verdict preflight, completion_failures.raise_completion_workflow_failure) but its File impact list omits the files those symbols live in. Verified by grep for emit_gate_error: the completion ERROR emitters are at gate_dispatch.py:687 (inside produce_completion_verdict) and completion_failures.py:227 (inside raise_completion_workflow_failure). The impact list contains neither file; it lists gate_ops.py instead, which contains no emit_ga